  "items": [
    {
      "source": "Resolve <a href=\"MongoTransactionOptions.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb\"><code>MongoTransactionOptions</code></a> from a given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/transaction/TransactionDefinition.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.transaction\"><code>TransactionDefinition</code></a> by evaluating\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/transaction/interceptor/TransactionAttribute.html#getLabels()\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.transaction.interceptor\"><code>TransactionAttribute.getLabels()</code></a> labels if possible.",
      "translation": "从给定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/transaction/TransactionDefinition.html\" title=\"类或接口在 org.springframework.transaction\"><code>TransactionDefinition</code></a> 解析出 <a href=\"MongoTransactionOptions.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb 中的接口\"><code>MongoTransactionOptions</code></a>，若可能的话，通过评估 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/transaction/interceptor/TransactionAttribute.html#getLabels()\" title=\"类或接口在 org.springframework.transaction.interceptor\"><code>TransactionAttribute.getLabels()</code></a> 的标签来实现。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Convert the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a> into an instance of <a href=\"MongoTransactionOptions.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb\"><code>MongoTransactionOptions</code></a>.",
      "translation": "将给定的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a>转换为<a href=\"MongoTransactionOptions.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb\"><code>MongoTransactionOptions</code></a>的实例。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Obtain the default <a href=\"MongoTransactionOptionsResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb\"><code>MongoTransactionOptionsResolver</code></a> implementation using a mongo:\n<a href=\"#getLabelPrefix()\"><code>prefix</code></a>.",
      "translation": "使用 MongoDB 的<a href=\"#getLabelPrefix()\"><code>prefix</code></a>获取默认的<a href=\"MongoTransactionOptionsResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb\"><code>MongoTransactionOptionsResolver</code></a>实现。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Get the prefix used to filter applicable <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/transaction/interceptor/TransactionAttribute.html#getLabels()\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.transaction.interceptor\"><code>labels</code></a>.",
      "translation": "获取用于筛选适用<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/transaction/interceptor/TransactionAttribute.html#getLabels()\" title=\"org.springframework.transaction.interceptor 中的类或接口\"><code>labels</code></a>的前缀。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "By default <a href=\"#resolve(org.springframework.transaction.TransactionDefinition)\"><code>resolve(TransactionDefinition)</code></a> will filter labels by the <a href=\"#getLabelPrefix()\"><code>prefix</code></a> and\nstrip the prefix from the label before handing the pruned <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a> to the <a href=\"#convert(java.util.Map)\"><code>convert(Map)</code></a> function.",
      "translation": "默认情况下，<a href=\"#resolve(org.springframework.transaction.TransactionDefinition)\"><code>resolve(TransactionDefinition)</code></a> 会根据 <a href=\"#getLabelPrefix()\"><code>prefix</code></a> 过滤标签，并在将修剪后的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a> 传递给 <a href=\"#convert(java.util.Map)\"><code>convert(Map)</code></a> 函数之前从标签中移除该前缀。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Splits applicable labels property style using = as deliminator and removes a potential\n<a href=\"#getLabelPrefix()\"><code>prefix</code></a> before calling <a href=\"#convert(java.util.Map)\"><code>convert(Map)</code></a> with filtered label values.",
      "translation": "使用 \"=\" 作为分隔符拆分适用的标签属性样式，并在调用带有过滤后标签值的 <a href=\"#convert(java.util.Map)\"><code>convert(Map)</code></a> 之前，移除潜在的 <a href=\"#getLabelPrefix()\"><code>prefix</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/transaction/interceptor/TransactionAttribute.html#getLabels()\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.transaction.interceptor\"><code>TransactionAttribute.getLabels()</code></a> evaluated by default should follow the property style using <code>=</code> to\nseparate key and value pairs.",
      "translation": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/transaction/interceptor/TransactionAttribute.html#getLabels()\" title=\"org.springframework.transaction.interceptor 中的类或接口\"><code>TransactionAttribute.getLabels()</code></a> 默认评估时应遵循属性样式，使用 <code>=</code> 分隔键值对。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<small>Copyright © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>. All rights reserved.</small>",
      "translation": "<small>版权所有 © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>。保留所有权利。</small>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "A transaction definition with labels targeting MongoDB may look like the following:",
      "translation": "带有标签且针对 MongoDB 的事务定义可能如下所示：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"MongoTransactionOptions.html#NONE\"><code>MongoTransactionOptions.NONE</code></a> in case the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/transaction/TransactionDefinition.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.transaction\"><code>TransactionDefinition</code></a> is not a\n        <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/transaction/interceptor/TransactionAttribute.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.transaction.interceptor\"><code>TransactionAttribute</code></a> if no matching <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/transaction/interceptor/TransactionAttribute.html#getLabels()\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.transaction.interceptor\"><code>labels</code></a> could be found.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"MongoTransactionOptions.html#NONE\"><code>MongoTransactionOptions.NONE</code></a>，如果给定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/transaction/TransactionDefinition.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.transaction\"><code>TransactionDefinition</code></a> 不是\n        <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/transaction/interceptor/TransactionAttribute.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.transaction.interceptor\"><code>TransactionAttribute</code></a>，且未找到匹配的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/transaction/interceptor/TransactionAttribute.html#getLabels()\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.transaction.interceptor\"><code>labels</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "instance of default <a href=\"MongoTransactionOptionsResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb\"><code>MongoTransactionOptionsResolver</code></a> implementation.",
      "translation": "默认为<a href=\"MongoTransactionOptionsResolver.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb 中的接口\"><code>MongoTransactionOptionsResolver</code></a>实现的实例。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalArgumentException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">IllegalArgumentException</a></code> - for options that do not map to valid transactions options or malformatted labels.",
      "translation": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalArgumentException.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\">IllegalArgumentException</a></code> - 用于选项无法映射到有效的交易选项，或标签格式不正确时。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalArgumentException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">IllegalArgumentException</a></code> - for invalid options.",
      "translation": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalArgumentException.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\">IllegalArgumentException</a></code> - 用于无效选项。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>options</code> - never null.",
      "translation": "<code>options</code> - 永远不为 null。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Christoph Strobl",
      "translation": "克里斯托夫·施特罗布",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "null if no label defined.",
      "translation": "未定义标签时返回 null。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "never null.",
      "translation": "永不为空。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "A <code>TransactionOptionResolver</code> reading MongoDB specific <a href=\"MongoTransactionOptions.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb\"><code>transaction options</code></a> from\na <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/transaction/TransactionDefinition.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.transaction\"><code>TransactionDefinition</code></a>. Implementations of <a href=\"MongoTransactionOptions.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb\"><code>MongoTransactionOptions</code></a> may choose a specific\n<a href=\"#getLabelPrefix()\"><code>prefix</code></a> for <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/transaction/interceptor/TransactionAttribute.html#getLabels()\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.transaction.interceptor\"><code>transaction attribute labels</code></a> to avoid\nevaluating non-store specific ones.",
      "translation": "`TransactionOptionResolver` 用于从 `TransactionDefinition` 中读取 MongoDB 特定的<a href=\"MongoTransactionOptions.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb\"><code>事务选项</code></a>。`MongoTransactionOptions` 接口的实现可以选择一个特定的<a href=\"#getLabelPrefix()\"><code>前缀</code></a>用于<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/transaction/interceptor/TransactionAttribute.html#getLabels()\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.transaction.interceptor\"><code>事务属性标签</code></a>，以避免评估非存储特定的标签。",
      "count": 1
    }
  ]
}